msgid "Molecular geometry"
msgstr "分子几何结构"

msgid "Geometry specifications"
msgstr "几何结构规范"

msgid ""
"The geometry may be given in standard Z-matrix form, or XYZ form, either in "
"the input or in a separate file (see section `geometry files "
"<molecular_geometry.html#geometry-files>`__). The geometry specifications "
"are given in the form"
msgstr ""
"几何结构可以以标准 Z-矩阵形式或 XYZ 形式给出，可以在输入中或单独的文件中提供（参见 `geometry files "
"<molecular_geometry.html#geometry-files>`__ 一节）。几何结构规范以以下形式给出"

msgid "``GEOMETRY={ atom specifications }``"
msgstr "``GEOMETRY={ atom specifications }``"

msgid ""
"``GEOMETRY`` must come after the other commands that modify the way the "
"geometry is constructed. The following are permitted as ``SYMMETRY`` "
"options:"
msgstr "``GEOMETRY`` 必须放在其他修改几何结构构建方式的命令之后。以下可作为 ``SYMMETRY`` 选项："

msgid ""
"Any valid combination of symmetry generators, as described in section "
"`symmetry specification <molecular_geometry.html#symmetry-specification>`__ "
"below."
msgstr ""
"任何有效的对称性生成元组合，如下方 `对称性规范 <molecular_geometry.html#symmetry-specification>`__"
" 章节所述。"

msgid ""
"Disable use of symmetry. Instead of ``SYMMETRY,NOSYM`` also just ``NOSYM`` "
"can be used."
msgstr "禁用对称性。除了 ``SYMMETRY,NOSYM``\\ ，也可以仅使用 ``NOSYM``\\ 。"

msgid "Enable use of symmetry."
msgstr "启用对称性。"

msgid "The following are permitted as ``ORIENT`` options:"
msgstr "以下可作为 ``ORIENT`` 选项："

msgid ""
"``CHARGE`` Orient molecule such that origin is centre of nuclear charge, and"
" axes are eigenvectors of quadrupole moment."
msgstr "``CHARGE`` 将分子定向，使原点位于核电荷中心，坐标轴为四极矩的特征向量。"

msgid ""
"``MASS`` Orient molecule such that origin is centre of mass, and axes are "
"eigenvectors of inertia tensor (default for Z-matrix input). Alternatively, "
"the symmetry centre can be specified as ``CENTRE=MASS|CHARGE``."
msgstr ""
"``MASS`` 将分子定向，使原点位于质心，坐标轴为惯性张量的特征向量（Z-矩阵输入的默认设置）。或者，对称中心可以指定为 "
"``CENTRE=MASS|CHARGE``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``NOORIENT`` Disable re-orientation of molecule (default for XYZ-input)."
msgstr "``NOORIENT`` 禁用分子的重新定向（XYZ 输入的默认设置）。"

msgid ""
"``PLANEXZ`` For the :math:`C_{2v}` and :math:`D_{2h}` point groups, force "
"the primary plane to be :math:`xz` instead of the default :math:`yz`. The "
"geometry builder attempts by swapping coordinate axes to place as many atoms"
" as possible in the primary plane, so for the particular case of a planar "
"molecule, this means that all the atoms will lie in the primary plane. The "
"default implements recommendation :math:`5a` and the first part of "
"recommendation :math:`5b` specified in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1740655>`__ **23**, 1997 (1955). ``PLANEYZ`` "
"and ``PLANEXY`` may also be specified, but note that the latter presently "
"generates an error for :math:`C_{2v}`."
msgstr ""
"``PLANEXZ`` 对于 :math:`C_{2v}` 和 :math:`D_{2h}` 点群，强制主平面为 :math:`xz` 而非默认的 "
":math:`yz`\\ "
"。几何构建器尝试通过交换坐标轴将尽可能多的原子置于主平面内，因此对于平面分子的特殊情况，这意味着所有原子都将位于主平面内。默认实现遵循 `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1740655>`__ **23**, 1997 (1955) "
"中指定的建议 :math:`5a` 和建议 :math:`5b` 的第一部分。也可以指定 ``PLANEYZ`` 和 ``PLANEXY``\\ "
"，但请注意后者目前对 :math:`C_{2v}` 会产生错误。"

msgid ""
"``ANGSTROM`` Forces bond lengths that are specified by numbers, or variables"
" without associated units, to use the values as a number of Ångstrom, rather"
" than Bohr."
msgstr "``ANGSTROM`` 强制将数字或未关联单位的变量指定的键长值用作埃（Ångstrom）数，而非玻尔（Bohr）。"

msgid ""
"``BOHR`` Forces bond lengths that are specified by numbers, or variables "
"without associated units, to use the values as a number of Bohr. This is "
"useful in the case of xyz-input with coordinates given in Bohr."
msgstr "``BOHR`` 强制将数字或未关联单位的变量指定的键长值用作玻尔（Bohr）数。这在 xyz 输入坐标以玻尔为单位的情况下很有用。"

msgid "Z-matrix input"
msgstr "Z-矩阵输入"

msgid "The general form of an atom specification line is"
msgstr "原子指定行的通用形式为"

msgid "or, alternatively,"
msgstr "或者，另一种形式为"

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid ""
"All atoms, including those related by symmetry transformations, should be "
"specified in the Z-matrix. Note that for the first atom, no coordinates need"
" be given, for the second atom only :math:`p_1,r` are needed, whilst for the"
" third atom :math:`p_3,\\beta,J` may be omitted. The 6 missing coordinates "
"are obtained automatically by the program, which translates and re-orients "
"the molecule such that the origin is at the centre of mass, and the axes "
"correspond to the eigenvectors of the inertia tensor (see also ``CHARGE`` "
"option above)."
msgstr ""
"所有原子，包括通过对称性变换相关的原子，都应在 Z-矩阵中指定。注意，对于第一个原子，无需给出坐标；对于第二个原子，仅需 :math:`p_1,r`\\"
" ；而对于第三个原子，\\ :math:`p_3,\\beta,J` 可以省略。缺失的 6 "
"个坐标由程序自动获取，程序将平移并重新定向分子，使得原点位于质心，坐标轴对应于惯性张量的特征向量（另见上文 ``CHARGE`` 选项）。"

msgid ""
"Variable names, and in general expressions that are linear in all dependent "
"variables, may be used as well as fixed numerical values for the parameters "
":math:`r`, :math:`\\alpha` and :math:`\\beta`. These expressions are "
"evaluated as late as possible, so that it is possible, for example, to set "
"up loops in which these parameters are changed; the geometry optimizer also "
"understands this construction, and will optimize the energy with respect to "
"the value of the variables. Non-linear expressions should not be used, "
"because the geometry optimization module is unable to differentiate them."
msgstr ""
"变量名，以及通常在所有因变量中呈线性的表达式，可以与参数 :math:`r`\\ 、\\ :math:`\\alpha` 和 "
":math:`\\beta` "
"的固定数值一起使用。这些表达式会尽可能晚地求值，因此可以设置循环来改变这些参数；几何优化器也能理解这种构造，并将根据变量的值优化能量。不应使用非线性表达式，因为几何优化模块无法对它们进行微分。"

msgid ""
"Note that symmetry is not implemented in density fitting methods, and in "
"these cases the NOSYM option is implied automatically."
msgstr "注意，对称性在密度拟合方法中未实现，在这些情况下会自动隐含 NOSYM 选项。"

msgid ""
"Also note that by default the automatic orientation of the molecule only "
"takes place if the geometry is defined by internal (Z-matrix) coordinates. "
"In case of ``XYZ`` Input the orientation is unchanged, unless the ``MASS`` "
"option is specified in the geometry block."
msgstr ""
"还需注意，默认情况下，只有当几何结构由内坐标（Z-矩阵）定义时，才会自动进行分子的自动定向。对于 ``XYZ`` 输入，除非在几何结构块中指定了 "
"``MASS`` 选项，否则方向保持不变。"

msgid "XYZ input"
msgstr "XYZ 输入"

msgid ""
"The XYZ file format consists of two header lines, the first of which "
"contains the number of atoms, and the second of which is a title. The "
"remaining lines each specify the coordinates of one atom, with the chemical "
"symbol in the first field, and the :math:`x`, :math:`y`, :math:`z` "
"coordinates following. A sequence number may be appended to the chemical "
"symbol; it is then interpreted as the atomic group number, which can be used"
" when different basis sets are wanted for different atoms of the same kind. "
"The basis set is then specified for this group number rather than the atomic"
" symbol. As a further extension, the first two header lines can be omitted."
msgstr ""
"XYZ 文件格式由两个标题行组成，第一行包含原子数，第二行是标题。其余各行分别指定一个原子的坐标，第一个字段是化学符号，后面是 :math:`x`\\ "
"、\\ :math:`y`\\ 、\\ :math:`z` "
"坐标。可以在化学符号后附加一个序列号；然后它被解释为原子组号，当同种原子的不同原子需要不同的基组时可以使用。然后为该组号而不是原子符号指定基组。作为进一步的扩展，可以省略前两个标题行。"

msgid ""
"The `XYZ format <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XYZ_file_format>`__ had been "
"specified within the documentation distributed with the Minnesota "
"Supercomputer Center’s XMol package. Note that Molpro has the facility to "
"write XYZ files with the ``PUT`` command (see section `writing files for "
"postprocessing(PUT) <molecular_geometry.html#writing-files-for-"
"postprocessing-put>`__)."
msgstr ""
"`XYZ 格式 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XYZ_file_format>`__ 已在明尼苏达超级计算机中心 "
"XMol 软件包分发的文档中指定。请注意，Molpro 具有使用 ``PUT`` 命令写入 XYZ 文件的功能（参见 `writing files "
"for postprocessing(PUT) <molecular_geometry.html#writing-files-for-"
"postprocessing-put>`__ 节）。"

msgid "Geometry Files"
msgstr "几何结构文件"

msgid "Using the format"
msgstr "使用格式"

msgid ""
"the geometry definitions are read from *file*, instead of inline. For the "
"name of the *file* and the characters allowed, similar recommendations hold "
"as for the Molpro input file, see "
"https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=quickstart#how_to_run_molpro"
"  . The geometry file together with a path to it may however be used."
msgstr ""
"几何定义将从\\ *文件*\\ 中读取，而非内联定义。对于\\ *文件*\\ 的名称和允许的字符，其建议与Molpro输入文件类似，请参阅 "
"https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=quickstart#how_to_run_molpro"
" 。然而，可以使用几何文件及其路径。"

msgid ""
"For series of similar calculations for different molecules the filename can "
"be provided as a variable via the molpro script. The general format is"
msgstr "对于针对不同分子的一系列类似计算，可以通过molpro脚本以变量的形式提供文件名。通用格式为"

msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "``geometry=$mol.xyz``"
msgstr "``geometry=$mol.xyz``"

msgid "with ``molpro --name mol=h2o ...``. Alternatively"
msgstr "配合 ``molpro --name mol=h2o …`` 使用。或者"

msgid "``geometry=$mol``"
msgstr "``geometry=$mol``"

msgid ""
"with ``molpro --name mol=h2o.xyz ...``. Both forms evaluate to "
"``geometry=h2o.xyz``."
msgstr "使用 ``molpro --name mol=h2o.xyz …``\\ 。两种形式最终都解析为 ``geometry=h2o.xyz``\\ 。"

msgid "Another useful possibility is"
msgstr "另一个有用的可能性是"

msgid ""
"with ``molpro -V n=3 ...``, which evaluates to ``geometry=product3.xyz``."
msgstr "使用 ``molpro -V n=3 …``\\ ，这将解析为 ``geometry=product3.xyz``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Note that the variables defining the geometry filename cannot be defined in "
"the input file, they can only be provided via the molpro script."
msgstr "请注意，定义几何文件名的变量不能在输入文件中定义，它们只能通过 molpro 脚本提供。"

msgid "Symmetry specification"
msgstr "对称性指定"

msgid ""
"If standard Z-matrix input is used, ``MOLPRO`` determines the symmetry "
"automatically by default. However, sometimes it is necessary to use a lower "
"symmetry or a different orientation than obtained by the default, and this "
"can be achieved by explicit specification of the symmetry elements to be "
"used, as described below."
msgstr ""
"如果使用标准 Z-矩阵输入，\\ ``MOLPRO`` "
"默认会自动确定对称性。然而，有时需要使用比默认获得的更低的对称性或不同的取向，这可以通过显式指定要使用的对称元素来实现，如下所述。"

msgid ""
"Generating symmetry elements, which uniquely specify the point group, can be"
" specified on the ``SYMMETRY`` directive. This must be given *before* the "
"geometry block. Each symmetry directive only affects the subsequent geometry"
" block; after a geometry block has been processed, the defaults are "
"restored. Note that the specification of symmetry elements inside the "
"geometry block is no longer allowed."
msgstr ""
"生成对称元素（它们唯一地指定了点群）可以在 ``SYMMETRY`` 指令中指定。这必须在几何块\\ *之前*\\ "
"给出。每个对称指令仅影响后续的几何块；在一个几何块被处理后，默认设置会恢复。请注意，在几何块内部指定对称元素不再被允许。"

msgid "**(null card)** :math:`C_1` (i.e., no point group symmetry)"
msgstr "**(空卡片)** :math:`C_1`\\ （即，无点群对称性）"

msgid "``Z`` :math:`C_s`"
msgstr "``Z`` :math:`C_s`"

msgid "``XYZ`` :math:`C_i`"
msgstr "``XYZ`` :math:`C_i`"

msgid "``X,Y`` :math:`C_{2v}`"
msgstr "``X,Y`` :math:`C_{2v}`"

msgid "``XY,Z`` :math:`C_{2h}`"
msgstr "``XY,Z`` :math:`C_{2h}`"

msgid "``XZ,YZ`` :math:`D_2`"
msgstr "``XZ,YZ`` :math:`D_2`"

msgid "``X,Y,Z`` :math:`D_{2h}`"
msgstr "``X,Y,Z`` :math:`D_{2h}`"

msgid ""
"Note that Abelian point group symmetry only is available, so for molecules "
"with degenerate symmetry, an Abelian subgroup must be used — e.g, "
":math:`C_{2v}` or :math:`D_{2h}` for linear molecules."
msgstr ""
"请注意，仅支持阿贝尔点群对称性，因此对于具有简并对称性的分子，必须使用阿贝尔子群——例如，对于线性分子使用 :math:`C_{2v}` 或 "
":math:`D_{2h}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"See section `symmetry <general_program_structure.html#symmetry>`__ for more "
"details of symmetry groups and ordering of the irreducible representations. "
"Also see section `Z-matrix input <molecular_geometry.html#z-matrix-input>`__"
" for more information about automatic generation of symmetry planes."
msgstr ""
"有关对称性群和不可约表示排序的更多详细信息，请参阅 `symmetry "
"<general_program_structure.html#symmetry>`__ 部分。另请参阅 `Z-matrix input "
"<molecular_geometry.html#z-matrix-input>`__ 部分，了解关于对称面自动生成的更多信息。"

msgid ""
"Note that by default the automatic orientation of the molecule only takes "
"place if the geometry is defined by internal (Z-matrix) coordinates. In case"
" of ``XYZ`` Input the orientation is unchanged, unless the ``MASS`` option "
"is specified in the geometry block."
msgstr ""
"请注意，默认情况下，仅当几何结构由内坐标（Z-矩阵）定义时，才会自动进行分子取向调整。对于 ``XYZ`` 输入，除非在几何结构块中指定了 "
"``MASS`` 选项，否则取向保持不变。"

msgid "Writing files for postprocessing(PUT)"
msgstr "为后处理写入文件(PUT)"

msgid ""
"The ``PUT`` command may be used at any point in the input to print, or write"
" to a file, the current geometry. The syntax is"
msgstr "``PUT`` 命令可在输入中的任意位置使用，以打印或将当前几何结构写入文件。其语法为"

msgid ""
"If *style* is ``GAUSSIAN``, a complete Gaussian input file will be written; "
"in that case, ``info`` will be used for the first (route) data line, and "
"defaults to ‘\\ ``# SP``\\ ’."
msgstr ""
"如果 *style* 是 ``GAUSSIAN``\\ ，将写入一个完整的 Gaussian 输入文件；在这种情况下，\\ ``info`` "
"将用于第一条（路由）数据行，默认为 ‘\\ ``# SP``\\ ’。"

msgid ""
"If *style* is ``MOLDEN``, an interface file for the `MOLDEN "
"<https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ visualization program is created; "
"further details and examples are given below."
msgstr ""
"如果 *style* 是 ``MOLDEN``\\ ，将为 `MOLDEN <https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ "
"可视化程序创建一个接口文件；更多细节和示例将在下文给出。"

msgid ""
"If *style* is ``IRSPEC``, a gnuplot input file will be written, which can be"
" used to plot an IR spectrum. The gnuplot file contains Lorentz functions "
"with the results of the previous vibrational calculation (``VSCF`` `the VSCF"
" program (VSCF) <vibrational_scf_programs.html#the-vscf-program-vscf>`__, "
"``VCI`` `the VCI program (VCI) <vibration_correlation_programs.html#the-vci-"
"program-vci>`__). Input examples can be found in these chapters."
msgstr ""
"如果 *style* 是 ``IRSPEC``\\ ，将写入一个 gnuplot 输入文件，可用于绘制红外光谱。该 gnuplot "
"文件包含基于先前振动计算结果（\\ ``VSCF`` `VSCF 程序 (VSCF) "
"<vibrational_scf_programs.html#the-vscf-program-vscf>`__\\ 、\\ ``VCI`` `VCI "
"程序 (VCI) <vibration_correlation_programs.html#the-vci-program-vci>`__\\ "
"）的洛伦兹函数。输入示例可在这些章节中找到。"

msgid "``NOFREQUENCIES`` Skip output of normal modes"
msgstr "``NOFREQUENCIES`` 跳过简正模式的输出"

msgid "``NOORBITALS`` Skip output of molecular orbitals"
msgstr "``NOORBITALS`` 跳过分子轨道的输出"

msgid ""
"``NOSKIPVIRT`` Include virtual, as well as occupied, molecular orbitals"
msgstr "``NOSKIPVIRT`` 包含虚拟分子轨道以及占据分子轨道"

msgid "``NOBASIS`` Skip output of basis set specification"
msgstr "``NOBASIS`` 跳过基组规格的输出"

msgid "``NOVARIABLES`` Skip output of Molpro variables"
msgstr "``NOVARIABLES`` 跳过Molpro变量的输出"

msgid ""
"``KEEPSPH`` Express orbitals in terms of spherical-harmonic functions rather"
" than converting to cartesian"
msgstr "``KEEPSPH`` 使用球谐函数而非笛卡尔函数表示轨道"

msgid ""
"If *style* is ``TREXIO``, then the geometry and orbitals are written to a "
"`TREXIO <https://github.com//trex-coe/trexio>`__ file. As with ``XML``, the "
"orbitals can be controlled or omitted using the ``NOORBITALS`` and "
"``NOSKIPVIRT`` options."
msgstr ""
"如果 *style* 是 ``TREXIO``\\ ，则几何结构和轨道将被写入一个 `TREXIO <https://github.com//trex-"
"coe/trexio>`__ 文件。与 ``XML`` 类似，可以使用 ``NOORBITALS`` 和 ``NOSKIPVIRT`` "
"选项来控制或省略轨道输出。"

msgid ""
"If *style* is of the form ``BABEL/``\\ *format*, then, where possible, the "
"external shell command ``obabel`` will be used to convert the geometry to "
"any format supported by the `OpenBabel <http://openbabel.org>`__ package. "
"For the possible values of *format*, see `OpenBabel’s documentation "
"<http://openbabel.org/docs/current/FileFormats/Overview.html>`__. If "
"``obabel`` is not installed on the system, then nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"如果 *style* 是 ``BABEL/``\\ *format* 形式，则在可能的情况下，将使用外部 shell 命令 ``obabel`` "
"将几何结构转换为 `OpenBabel <http://openbabel.org>`__ 包支持的任何格式。关于 *format* 的可能值，请参阅 "
"`OpenBabel 的文档 "
"<http://openbabel.org/docs/current/FileFormats/Overview.html>`__\\ 。如果系统未安装 "
"``obabel``\\ ，则不会发生任何操作。"

msgid ""
"If *style* is omitted, the Z-matrix, current geometry, and, where "
"applicable, gradient are written."
msgstr "如果省略 *style*\\ ，则写入 Z-矩阵、当前几何结构以及（如适用）梯度。"

msgid ""
"*file* specifies a file name to which the data is written; if blank, the "
"data is written to the output stream. If *status* is omitted or set to "
"``NEW``, any old contents of the file are destroyed; otherwise the file is "
"appended."
msgstr ""
"*file* 指定写入数据的文件名；若为空，则数据写入输出流。若 *status* 被省略或设为 ``NEW``\\ "
"，则文件的旧内容将被销毁；否则将追加到文件。"

msgid ""
"A subcommand ``ORBITAL`` can be given, using the syntax given in section "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__, to specify a set of orbitals other than the default. "
"Using this keyword is recommended if several orbitals sets are computed with"
" one input file, and especially necessary when orbitals such as natural "
"orbitals from CCSD shall be exported."
msgstr ""
"可以给出子命令 ``ORBITAL``\\ ，使用 `选择轨道和密度矩阵（ORBITAL, DENSITY） "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ "
"一节中给出的语法，以指定一组非默认的轨道。如果使用一个输入文件计算多个轨道集，建议使用此关键词；当需要导出诸如来自 CCSD "
"的自然轨道等轨道时，尤其必要。"

msgid "Visualization of results using Molden"
msgstr "使用 Molden 可视化结果"

msgid ""
"Geometry, molecular orbital, and normal mode information, when available, is"
" dumped by ``PUT,MOLDEN`` in the format that is usable by `MOLDEN "
"<https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__."
msgstr ""
"几何结构、分子轨道和简正模式信息（若可用）会通过 ``PUT,MOLDEN`` 以 `MOLDEN "
"<https://www3.cmbi.umcn.nl/molden>`__ 可用的格式转储。"

msgid ""
"The example below generates all the information required to plot the "
"molecular orbitals of water, and to visualize the normal modes of vibration:"
msgstr "下面的示例生成了绘制水分子分子轨道和可视化振动简正模式所需的所有信息："

msgid ""
"The example below does a difference density by presenting its natural "
"orbitals to MOLDEN. Note that although MOLDEN has internal features for "
"difference density plots, the approach shown here is more general in that it"
" bypasses the restriction to STO-3G, 3-21G, 4-31G and 6-31G basis sets."
msgstr ""
"下面的示例通过将其自然轨道呈现给 MOLDEN 来进行差分密度计算。请注意，尽管 MOLDEN "
"内部具有差分密度绘图功能，但此处展示的方法更为通用，因为它绕过了对 STO-3G、3-21G、4-31G 和 6-31G 基组的限制。"

msgid "Lattice of point charges"
msgstr "点电荷晶格"

msgid ""
"*outfile* specifies a file name to which the lattice gradient is written; if"
" blank, it will be written to the output stream."
msgstr "*outfile* 指定一个文件名，晶格梯度将被写入该文件；如果留空，则写入输出流。"

msgid ""
"``VARGRAD`` (logical) Stores the lattice gradient in variable ``VARGRAD``."
msgstr "``VARGRAD`` (逻辑值) 将晶格梯度存储在变量 ``VARGRAD`` 中。"

msgid ""
"``NUCONLY`` (logical) Disables gradient evaluation with respect to the "
"lattice, independent of *flag* in the lattice file."
msgstr "``NUCONLY`` (逻辑值) 禁用相对于晶格的梯度评估，与晶格文件中的 *flag* 无关。"

msgid "``REMOVE`` (logical) Removes the lattice."
msgstr "``REMOVE`` (逻辑值) 移除晶格。"

msgid "Symmetry is not supported for lattice gradients."
msgstr "晶格梯度不支持对称性。"

msgid ""
"Note that the nuclear repulsion energy (and therefore also the total energy)"
" is computed without including the Coulomb interaction between the point "
"charges."
msgstr "请注意，核排斥能（因此也包括总能量）的计算不包含点电荷之间的库仑相互作用。"

msgid "Redefining and printing atomic masses"
msgstr "重新定义和打印原子质量"

msgid "The current masses of all atoms can be printed using"
msgstr "所有原子的当前质量可以使用以下命令打印"

msgid "The atomic masses can be redefined using"
msgstr "原子质量可以通过以下方式重新定义"

msgid ""
"The optional keyword *type* can take either the value ``AVER[AGE]`` for "
"using average isotope masses, or ``ISO[TOPE]`` for using the masses of the "
"most abundant isotopes. This affects only the rotational constants and "
"vibrational frequencies. As in most quantum chemistry packages, the default "
"for *type* is ``AVERAGE``. If ``INIT`` is given, all previous mass "
"definitions are deleted and the defaults are reset."
msgstr ""
"可选关键字 *type* 可以取值为 ``AVER[AGE]`` 以使用平均同位素质量，或取值为 ``ISO[TOPE]`` "
"以使用最丰富同位素的质量。这仅影响转动常数和振动频率。与大多数量子化学软件包一样，\\ *type* 的默认值为 ``AVERAGE``\\ "
"。如果指定了 ``INIT``\\ ，则所有先前的质量定义将被删除，并重置为默认值。"

msgid ""
"Individual masses can be changed by the following entries, where *symbol* is"
" the chemical symbol of the atom and *mass* is the associated mass. Several "
"entries can be given on one ``MASS`` card, and/or several ``MASS`` cards can"
" follow each other. The last given mass is used."
msgstr ""
"可以通过以下条目更改单个质量，其中 *symbol* 是原子的化学符号，\\ *mass* 是关联的质量。可以在一个 ``MASS`` "
"卡片上给出多个条目，并且/或多个 ``MASS`` 卡片可以相继出现。将使用最后给出的质量。"

msgid ""
"Note that specifying different isotope masses for symmetry related atoms "
"lowers the symmetry of the system if the molecular centre of mass is taken "
"as the origin. This effect can be avoided by using the charge centre as "
"origin, i.e., specifying ``CHARGE`` as the option to an ``ORIENT`` directive"
" before the ``GEOMETRY`` input:"
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果以分子质心为原点，为对称相关的原子指定不同的同位素质量会降低系统的对称性。可以通过使用电荷中心作为原点来避免此效应，即在 "
"``GEOMETRY`` 输入之前，为 ``ORIENT`` 指令指定 ``CHARGE`` 作为选项："

msgid "Example: two different masses for hydrogen in HD"
msgstr "示例：HD 中氢的两种不同质量"

msgid ""
"In analogy to defining two different basis sets for the same element (see  "
"`Examples for basis input <basis_input.html#examples>`__), also two "
"different masses can be defined."
msgstr ""
"类似于为同一元素定义两个不同的基组（参见\\ `基组输入示例 <basis_input.html#examples>`__\\ "
"），也可以定义两个不同的质量。"

msgid ""
"For performing counterpoise corrected geometry optimizations see section "
"`optimizing counterpoise corrected energies "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-counterpoise-corrected-"
"energies>`__."
msgstr ""
"关于执行均衡校正的几何优化，请参阅章节\\ `优化均衡校正能量 <geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-"
"counterpoise-corrected-energies>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Dummy centres"
msgstr "哑原子中心"

msgid ""
"If the option ``SKIP`` is given, basis functions at the specified atoms are "
"not included. This option is not possible with zmatrix geometry inputs, xyz "
"inputs have to be used."
msgstr "如果给出选项 ``SKIP``\\ ，则指定原子处的基函数将不被包含。此选项不能用于Z-矩阵几何输入，必须使用XYZ输入。"

msgid ""
"Note that the current setting of dummies is remembered by the program across"
" restarts via the ``MOLPRO`` variable ``DUMMYATOMS``. Dummies can be reset "
"to their original charges using a ``DUMMY`` card with no entries. Dummy "
"centres are also reset to their original charges if (i) an ``INT`` command "
"is encountered, or (ii) a new geometry input is encountered."
msgstr ""
"请注意，程序通过 ``MOLPRO`` 变量 ``DUMMYATOMS`` 在重启时记住当前的哑原子设置。可以使用不带任何条目的 ``DUMMY`` "
"卡片将哑原子重置为其原始电荷。哑原子中心也会在以下情况下重置为其原始电荷：(i) 遇到 ``INT`` 命令时，或 (ii) 遇到新的几何输入时。"

msgid ""
"The program does not recognize automatically if the symmetry is reduced by "
"defining dummy atoms. Therefore, for a given dummy atom, either all symmetry"
" equivalent atoms must also be dummies, or the symmetry must be reduced "
"manually as required. An error will result if the symmetry is not consistent"
" with the dummy centre definitions."
msgstr ""
"程序不会自动识别定义哑原子是否降低了对称性。因此，对于给定的哑原子，要么所有对称等效原子也必须是哑原子，要么必须根据需要手动降低对称性。如果对称性与哑原子中心定义不一致，将导致错误。"

msgid "Counterpoise calculations"
msgstr "均衡校正计算"

msgid ""
"Counterpoise corrections are easily performed using dummy cards. One first "
"computes the energy of the total system, and then for the subsystems using "
"dummy cards. The process can, however, be automated using the command"
msgstr "使用虚拟原子卡可以轻松执行均衡校正。首先计算整个体系的能量，然后使用虚拟原子卡计算子体系的能量。然而，该过程可以使用命令自动完成"

msgid ""
"Without any options, this will calculate the ghost-orbital corrections to "
"dimer interaction energies using the last energy calculation to define the "
"dimer and the methods to be used. First of all, the molecule is "
"automatically partitioned into fragments. This is done by assigning all "
"interatomic distances as either intra- or intermolecular, comparing the "
"distance with the scaled sum of Bragg radii of the two atoms. The default "
"scale factor is 1.4, but it can be changed with ``SCALE=``\\ *scale*; for "
"the S66 database of intermolecular interactions, correct partitioning is "
"obtained with a scale factor in the range 1.2 to 1.95. If all of the "
"distances are intramolecular, then it will be assumed that the system is not"
" a non-bonded complex, and the counterpoise calculation will not be done at "
"all. This gives support for running the same Molpro input for both dimers "
"and monomers. At present, partitioning into more than two fragments is "
"discovered, but there is no supporting implementation of the counterpoise "
"correction."
msgstr ""
"在不指定任何选项的情况下，此命令将使用最后一次能量计算来定义二聚体和要使用的方法，计算二聚体相互作用能的虚轨道校正。首先，分子被自动划分为片段。这是通过将所有原子间距离分配为分子内或分子间距离，并将该距离与两个原子的布拉格半径缩放和进行比较来完成的。默认缩放因子为1.4，但可以通过"
" ``SCALE=``\\ *scale* "
"更改；对于分子间相互作用的S66数据库，缩放因子在1.2到1.95范围内可获得正确的划分。如果所有距离都是分子内的，则将假定该体系不是非键合复合物，并且根本不会执行均衡校正计算。这为对二聚体和单体运行相同的Molpro输入提供了支持。目前，可以识别划分为两个以上片段的情况，但尚未实现相应的均衡校正支持。"

msgid ""
"The counterpoise procedure performs four calculations. For each of the "
"identified monomers, it calculates the energy at the dimer geometry using "
"first the dimer basis set, and secondly just the basis functions tied to the"
" monomer atoms. The difference between these, the counterpoise correction, "
"is reported, and added to the previously-calculated dimer energy."
msgstr ""
"均衡校正过程执行四次计算。对于每个识别出的单体，它首先使用二聚体基组，然后仅使用与单体原子相关的基函数，在二聚体几何结构下计算其能量。这两者之间的差值，即均衡校正，将被报告并添加到先前计算的二聚体能量中。"

msgid ""
"Further options that specify the calculation to be run can be specified "
"exactly as for geometry optimisations; see section `options to select the "
"wavefunction and energy to be optimized "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-to-select-the-wavefunction-and-"
"energy-to-be-optimized>`__ for further details."
msgstr ""
"用于指定要运行的计算的进一步选项可以完全按照几何优化的方式指定；有关详细信息，请参阅章节 `options to select the "
"wavefunction and energy to be optimized "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#options-to-select-the-wavefunction-and-"
"energy-to-be-optimized>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Example: interaction energy of OH-Ar"
msgstr "示例：OH-Ar的相互作用能"

msgid "``[SYMMETRY, options ]``"
msgstr "``[SYMMETRY, options ]``"

msgid "``[ORIENT, options ]``"
msgstr "``[ORIENT, options ]``"

msgid "``[ANGSTROM]``"
msgstr "``[ANGSTROM]``"

msgid "``[BOHR]``"
msgstr "``[BOHR]``"

msgid ""
"**``SIGNX=``\\ :math:`\\pm1`** Force first non-zero :math:`x`-coordinate to "
"be positive or negative, respectively. Similarly, ``SIGNY``, ``SIGNZ`` can "
"be set for the :math:`y`- and :math:`z`-coordinates, respectively. This can "
"be useful to fix the orientation of the molecule across different "
"calculations and geometries. Alternatively, the system variables ``ZSIGNX``,"
" ``ZSIGNY``, ``ZSIGNZ`` can be set to positive or negative values to achieve"
" the same effect."
msgstr ""
"**``SIGNX=``\\ :math:`\\pm1`** 分别强制第一个非零的 :math:`x` 坐标为正或负。类似地，可分别为 "
":math:`y` 和 :math:`z` 坐标设置 ``SIGNY``\\ 、\\ ``SIGNZ``\\ "
"。这可用于在不同的计算和几何构型之间固定分子的取向。或者，可将系统变量 ``ZSIGNX``\\ 、\\ ``ZSIGNY``\\ 、\\ "
"``ZSIGNZ`` 设为正值或负值以达到相同效果。"

msgid "``[group[,]]atom, $p_1$, $r$, $p_2$, $\\alpha$, $p_3$, $\\beta$, $J$``"
msgstr "``[group[,]]atom, $p_1$, $r$, $p_2$, $\\alpha$, $p_3$, $\\beta$, $J$``"

msgid "``[group[,]]atom, $p_1$, $x$, $y$, $z$``"
msgstr "``[group[,]]atom, $p_1$, $x$, $y$, $z$``"

msgid ""
"***group*** atomic group number (optional). Can be used if different basis "
"sets are used for different atoms of the same kind. The basis set is then "
"referred to by this group number and not by the atomic symbol."
msgstr ""
"***group*** 原子组编号（可选）。当对同种元素的不同原子使用不同基组时可以使用。此时基组通过该组编号引用，而不是通过原子符号引用。"

msgid ""
"***atom*** chemical symbol of the new atom placed at position :math:`p_0`. "
"This may optionally be appended (without blank) by an integer, which can act"
" as sequence number, e.g., ``C1``, ``H2``, etc. Dummy centres with no charge"
" and basis functions are denoted X, optionally appended by a number, e.g, "
"X1."
msgstr ""
"***atom*** 放置在位置 :math:`p_0` 处的新原子的化学符号。可选地可在其后（不留空格）附加一个整数，用作序号，例如 ``C1``\\"
" 、\\ ``H2`` 等。无电荷和基函数的虚中心用 X 表示，可选地附加一个数字，例如 X1。"

msgid ""
":math:`p_1` atom to which the present atom is connected. This may be either "
"a number *n*, where :math:`n` refers to the :math:`n`\\ ’th line of the "
"Z-matrix, or an alphanumeric string as specified in the *atom* field of a "
"previous card, e.g., ``C1``, ``H2`` etc. The latter form works only if the "
"atoms are numbered in a unique way."
msgstr ""
":math:`p_1` 当前原子所连接的原子。这可以是一个数字 *n*\\ ，其中 :math:`n` 指 Z 矩阵的第 :math:`n`\\ "
"行；也可以是先前卡片 *atom* 字段中指定的字母数字字符串，例如 ``C1``\\ 、\\ ``H2`` 等。后一种形式仅在原子编号唯一时有效。"

msgid ""
":math:`r` Distance of new atom from :math:`p_1`. This value is given in "
"bohr, unless ``ANG`` has been specified directly before or after the "
"symmetry specification."
msgstr ""
":math:`r` 新原子到 :math:`p_1` 的距离。此值以 bohr 为单位给出，除非在对称性说明之前或之后直接指定了 ``ANG``\\ 。"

msgid ""
":math:`p_2` A second atom needed to define the angle "
":math:`\\alpha(p_0,p_1,p_2)`. The same rules hold for the specification as "
"for :math:`p_1`."
msgstr ""
":math:`p_2` 定义角度 :math:`\\alpha(p_0,p_1,p_2)` 所需的第二个原子。其指定规则与 :math:`p_1` "
"相同。"

msgid ""
":math:`\\alpha` Internuclear angle :math:`\\alpha(p_0,p_1,p_2)`. This angle "
"is given in degrees and must be in the range :math:`0 \\lt \\alpha \\lt "
"180^{0}`."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\alpha` 核间距角 :math:`\\alpha(p_0,p_1,p_2)`\\ 。此角度以度为单位给出，且必须位于范围 "
":math:`0 \\lt \\alpha \\lt 180^{0}` 内。"

msgid ""
":math:`p_3` A third atom needed to define the dihedral angle "
":math:`\\beta(p_0,p_1,p_2,p_3)`. Only applies if :math:`J=0`, see below."
msgstr ""
":math:`p_3` 定义二面角 :math:`\\beta(p_0,p_1,p_2,p_3)` 所需的第三个原子。仅在 :math:`J=0` "
"时适用，见下文。"

msgid ""
":math:`\\beta` Dihedral angle :math:`\\beta(p_0,p_1,p_2,p_3)` in degree. "
"This angle is defined as the angle between the planes defined by "
":math:`(p_0,p_1,p_2)` and :math:`(p_1,p_2,p_3)` (:math:`-180^{0} \\le \\beta"
" \\le 180^{o}`). Only applies if :math:`J=0`, see below."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\beta` 二面角 :math:`\\beta(p_0,p_1,p_2,p_3)`\\ ，以度为单位。此角度定义为由 "
":math:`(p_0,p_1,p_2)` 和 :math:`(p_1,p_2,p_3)` 所定义的平面之间的夹角（\\ :math:`-180^{0}"
" \\le \\beta \\le 180^{o}`\\ ）。仅在 :math:`J=0` 时适用，见下文。"

msgid ""
":math:`J` If this is specified and nonzero, the new position is specified by"
" two bond angles rather than a bond angle and a dihedral angle. If "
":math:`J=\\pm 1`, :math:`\\beta` is the angle :math:`\\beta(p_0,p_1,p_3)`. "
"If :math:`J=1`, the triple vector product :math:`({\\bf p}_1-{\\bf p}_0) "
"\\cdot [({\\bf p}_1-{\\bf p}_2) \\times ({\\bf p}_1-{\\bf p}_3)]` is "
"positive, while this quantity is negative if :math:`J=-1`."
msgstr ""
":math:`J` 若指定且非零，则新位置由两个键角而非一个键角和一个二面角确定。若 :math:`J=\\pm 1`\\ ，则 "
":math:`\\beta` 为角度 :math:`\\beta(p_0,p_1,p_3)`\\ 。若 :math:`J=1`\\ ，三矢积 "
":math:`({\\bf p}_1-{\\bf p}_0) \\cdot [({\\bf p}_1-{\\bf p}_2) \\times "
"({\\bf p}_1-{\\bf p}_3)]` 为正，而若 :math:`J=-1`\\ ，该量为负。"

msgid ""
"***x,y,z*** Cartesian coordinates of the new atom. This form is assumed if "
":math:`p_1\\le0`; if :math:`p_1\\lt 0`, the coordinates are frozen in "
"geometry optimizations."
msgstr ""
"***x,y,z*** 新原子的笛卡尔坐标。当 :math:`p_1\\le0` 时采用此形式；若 :math:`p_1\\lt 0`\\ "
"，则在几何优化中冻结该坐标。"

msgid ""
"Once the reorientation has been done, the program then looks for symmetry "
"(:math:`D_{2h}` and subgroups), unless the ``NOSYM`` option has been given. "
"It is possible to request that reduced symmetry be used by using appropriate"
" combinations of the options ``X,Y,Z,XY,XZ,YZ,XYZ``. These specify symmetry "
"operations, the symbol defining which coordinate axes change sign under the "
"operation. The point group is constructed by taking all combinations of "
"specified elements. If symmetry is explicitly specified in this way, the "
"program checks to see that the group requested can be used, swapping the "
"coordinate axes if necessary. This provides a mechanism for ensuring that "
"the same point group is used, for example, at all points in the complete "
"generation of a potential energy surface, allowing the safe re-utilization "
"of neighbouring geometry molecular orbitals as starting guesses, etc.. When "
"there is point-group symmetry, it is important to ensure that the dependence"
" of the Z-matrix geometry on variables is such that the symmetry cannot be "
"broken by any variation of those variables form their initial values; for "
"example, for the water molecule in C2v symmetry, the two O-H distances "
"should be specified using the same variable. Otherwise, numerical noise "
"accumulated during geometry optimisation can cause the symmetry to break, "
"leading to undefined behaviour."
msgstr ""
"完成重新取向后，程序随后寻找对称性（\\ :math:`D_{2h}` 及其子群），除非已给出 ``NOSYM`` 选项。可以通过适当组合选项 "
"``X,Y,Z,XY,XZ,YZ,XYZ`` "
"来请求使用降低的对称性。这些选项指定对称操作，其符号定义了在该操作下哪些坐标轴改变符号。点群通过取指定元素的所有组合来构造。若以这种方式显式指定对称性，程序会检查所请求的群是否可用，必要时交换坐标轴。这提供了一种机制，可确保例如在势能面完整生成的所有点上使用相同的点群，从而可安全地复用相邻几何构型的分子轨道作为初始猜测等。当存在点群对称性时，重要的是确保"
" Z 矩阵几何构型对变量的依赖关系使得任何变量偏离其初始值都不会破坏对称性；例如，对于处于 C2v 对称性的水分子，两个 O-H "
"距离应使用同一变量指定。否则，几何优化过程中累积的数值噪声可能导致对称性破坏，从而产生未定义的行为。"

msgid "An input for H2O could look like this:"
msgstr "H2O 的输入可能如下所示："

msgid "examples/h2o_zmatrix1.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_zmatrix1.inp"

msgid "Alternatively, this could be used:"
msgstr "或者，也可以使用："

msgid "examples/h2o_zmatrix2.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_zmatrix2.inp"

msgid ""
"Simple cartesian coordinates in Ångstrom units can be read as an alternative"
" to a Z matrix, either directly from the input stream, or from a file (see "
"section  `geometry files <molecular_geometry.html#geometry-files>`__).). "
"This facility is triggered by setting the Molpro variable ``GEOMTYP`` to the"
" value ``XYZ`` before the geometry specification is given, but usually this "
"does not need to be done, as a geometry specification where the first line "
"is a single integer will be recognized as XYZ format, as will the case of "
"the first line consisting of a chemical symbol followed by three cartesian "
"coordinates. The geometry block should then contain the cartesian "
"coordinates in XYZ format (Minnesota Supercomputer Center, Inc.). Only fixed"
" numerical values are allowed. In contrast to z-matrix input, expressions "
"containing variables are not permitted. Note that it is possible to present "
"cartesian coordinates using expressions, via the cartesian variant of "
"z-matrix input described above."
msgstr ""
"作为 Z 矩阵的替代，可以直接从输入流中或从文件中（参见 `geometry files "
"<molecular_geometry.html#geometry-files>`__ 一节）读取以 Ångstrom "
"为单位的简单笛卡尔坐标。在给出几何构型说明之前将 Molpro 变量 ``GEOMTYP`` 设为值 ``XYZ`` "
"即可启用此功能，但通常无需这样做，因为首行为单个整数的几何构型说明会被识别为 XYZ "
"格式，首行由化学符号后跟三个笛卡尔坐标组成的情况也是如此。此时几何构型块应包含 XYZ 格式的笛卡尔坐标（Minnesota Supercomputer"
" Center, Inc.）。仅允许固定数值。与 z-matrix 输入不同，不允许包含变量的表达式。注意，可以通过上述 z-matrix "
"输入的笛卡尔变体使用表达式来表示笛卡尔坐标。"

msgid ""
"Note that for XYZ input the default is not to reorient the molecule. "
"Orientation can be forced, however, by the ``MASS`` or ``CHARGE`` options on"
" the ``ORIENT`` directive. If orientation is requested, any approximately-"
"obeyed point-group symmetry is discovered, and the geometry refined to obey "
"that symmetry as closely as possible, as described in `J. Math. Chem. 60, "
"161-171 (2022) <https://doi.org/10.1007/s10910-021-01302-x>`__."
msgstr ""
"注意，对于 XYZ 输入，默认不重新取向分子。然而，可以通过 ``ORIENT`` 指令上的 ``MASS`` 或 ``CHARGE`` "
"选项强制进行取向。若请求取向，则会发现任何近似满足的点群对称性，并尽可能精细地调整几何构型以遵循该对称性，如 `J. Math. Chem. 60, "
"161-171 (2022) <https://doi.org/10.1007/s10910-021-01302-x>`__ 中所述。"

msgid "examples/h2o_xyzinput.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_xyzinput.inp"

msgid "``GEOMETRY=file``"
msgstr "``GEOMETRY=file``"

msgid "``geometry=string1$var1$var2'string2'$var3.extension``"
msgstr "``geometry=string1$var1$var2'string2'$var3.extension``"

msgid ""
"where ``$var1, $var2, $var3`` etc are either integer numbers (provided via "
"the ``-V`` molpro option) or string variables (provided via the ``--name`` "
"molpro option). Variable names end before the next dollar ($), quote ('), "
"full stop (.) or blank (end of line). Any number of variables is possible, "
"although usually one is sufficient. ``.extension`` is appended as given. "
"Strings in quotes between variables are also included as given. The "
"(optional) first string (string1 above) must not be in quotes."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``$var1, $var2, $var3`` 等要么是整数（通过 ``-V`` molpro 选项提供），要么是字符串变量（通过 "
"``--name`` molpro "
"选项提供）。变量名在下一个美元符号（$）、引号（'）、句点（.）或空白（行尾）之前结束。可以使用任意数量的变量，尽管通常一个就足够了。\\ "
"``.extension`` 按给定内容追加。变量之间引号内的字符串也按给定内容包含。第一个字符串（上文的 string1）是可选的，且不得加引号。"

msgid "``geometry=product$n.xyz``"
msgstr "``geometry=product$n.xyz``"

msgid ""
"The dimension of the point group is 2\\*\\*(number of fields given). Each "
"field consists of one or more of ``X, Y``, or ``Z`` (with no intervening "
"spaces) which specify which coordinate axes change sign under the "
"corresponding generating symmetry operation. It is usually wise to choose "
":math:`z` to be the unique axis where appropriate (essential for :math:`C_2`"
" and :math:`C_{2h}`). In that case, the possibilities are:"
msgstr ""
"点群的维数为 2\\*\\*\\ （给定字段数）。每个字段由一个或多个 ``X, Y`` 或 ``Z``\\ "
"（之间无空格）组成，它们指定在相应的生成对称操作下哪些坐标轴改变符号。在适当情况下，通常明智地选择 :math:`z` 作为唯一轴（对于 "
":math:`C_2` 和 :math:`C_{2h}` 是必需的）。此时可能的组合为："

msgid "``XY`` :math:`C_2`"
msgstr "``XY`` :math:`C_2`"

msgid "``PUT,style,file,status,info``"
msgstr "``PUT,style,file,status,info``"

msgid ""
"If *style* is ``XYZ``, an XYZ file will be written (see also section `XYZ "
"input <molecular_geometry.html#xyz-input>`__). If *style* is ``XYZGRAD``, an"
" XYZ file including energy gradients will be written (columns are: "
"x,y,z,charge,gx,gy,gz; gradient is given in -1\\*eV/A) If *style* is "
"``CRD``, the coordinates will be written in CHARMm CRD format."
msgstr ""
"如果 *style* 为 ``XYZ``\\ ，将写出一个 XYZ 文件（另见 `XYZ input "
"<molecular_geometry.html#xyz-input>`__ 一节）。如果 *style* 为 ``XYZGRAD``\\ "
"，将写出一个包含能量梯度的 XYZ 文件（各列依次为：x,y,z,charge,gx,gy,gz；梯度以 -1\\*eV/A 给出）。如果 *\\ "
"style* 为 ``CRD``\\ ，坐标将以 CHARMm CRD 格式写出。"

msgid ""
"If *style* is ``XML``, a dump of the current state is written, including "
"variables, geometry, basis set, latest orbitals. The file format is well-"
"formed XML, according to the https://www.molpro.net/schema/molpro-output.xsd"
" schema. In this case, additional options can be given:"
msgstr ""
"如果 *style* 为 ``XML``\\ ，将写出当前状态的转储，包括变量、几何结构、基组、最新的轨道。该文件格式为格式良好的 XML，遵循 "
"https://www.molpro.net/schema/molpro-output.xsd 模式。在这种情况下，可以给出附加选项："

msgid ""
"**``INDEX``,\\ *n*** Insert an ``index=“n”`` attribute into the "
"``<molecule>`` node that is produced."
msgstr "**``INDEX``,\\ *\\ n*** 在所生成的 ``<molecule>`` 节点中插入 ``index=“n”`` 属性。"

msgid ""
"``NOCOMPRESS`` By default the orbitals are stored with lossy compression "
"(approximately 32-bit precision) on a separate binary sidecar file. This "
"option forces instead the full writing of the orbitals in ASCII to the xml "
"stream"
msgstr ""
"``NOCOMPRESS`` 默认情况下，轨道以有损压缩（约 32 位精度）存储在单独的二进制附属文件中。此选项改为强制将轨道以 ASCII 完整写入 "
"xml 流"

