msgstr "examples/h2o_diffden_molden.inp"

msgid ""
"``LATTICE,[INFILE=input_file,] [OUTFILE= output_file,]  "
"[VARGRAD,] [NUCONLY,] [REMOVE]``"
msgstr ""
"``LATTICE,[INFILE=input_file,] [OUTFILE= output_file,]  [VARGRAD,] "
"[NUCONLY,] [REMOVE]``"

msgid ""
"Includes a lattice of point charges, for use in QM/MM calculations for "
"example (see section :doc:`QM/MM interfaces <qm_mm_interfaces>`). An "
"external file (*input_file*) should be given as input, with the following "
"format:"
msgstr ""
"包含一个点电荷晶格，例如用于 QM/MM 计算（见 :doc:`QM/MM interfaces <qm_mm_interfaces>` "
"一节）。应给出一个外部文件（\\ *input_file*\\ ）作为输入，其格式如下："

msgid ""
"*Comment line* *number of point charges N* :math:`x1,y1,z1,q1,`\\ *flag*\\ "
":math:`1` :math:`\\vdots` :math:`xN,yN,zN,qN,`\\ *flag*\\ :math:`N` The "
":math:`x,y` and :math:`z` fields stand for the point charge coordinates (in "
"Å), :math:`q` for its charge and *flag=1* indicates that gradients should be"
" computed for this lattice point (0 means no gradient). :math:`x,y`, "
":math:`z`, :math:`q` are floating point numbers, *flag* is an integer, e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"*注释行* *点电荷数目 N* :math:`x1,y1,z1,q1,`\\ *flag*\\ :math:`1` :math:`\\vdots` "
":math:`xN,yN,zN,qN,`\\ *flag*\\ :math:`N` 其中 :math:`x,y` 和 :math:`z` "
"字段表示点电荷坐标（单位 Å），\\ :math:`q` 表示其电荷，\\ *flag=1* 表示应针对该晶格点计算梯度（0 表示不计算梯度）。\\ "
":math:`x,y`\\ 、\\ :math:`z`\\ 、\\ :math:`q` 为浮点数，\\ *flag* 为整数，例如："

msgid "or (commas are optional here):"
msgstr "或者（此处逗号可选）："

msgid "``MASS, PRINT``"
msgstr "``MASS, PRINT``"

msgid "``MASS, [type,] [symbol=mass, …]``"
msgstr "``MASS, [type,] [symbol=mass, …]``"

