msgstr "examples/hd.inp"

msgid "``DUMMY,[SKIP],atom1,atom2,$\\ldots$``"
msgstr "``DUMMY,[SKIP],atom1,atom2,$\\ldots$``"

msgid ""
"Sets nuclear charges on atoms 1,2 etc. to zero, for doing counterpoise "
"calculations, for example. *atom1, atom2,*\\ :math:`\\dots` can be Z-matrix "
"row numbers or tag names. Ranges of consecutive atoms can be given as "
"*atom1,-atom2*, which means from *atom1* to *atom2* (here *atom1* and "
"*atom2* are z-matrix or xyz row numbers)"
msgstr ""
"将原子 1、2 等上的核电荷设为零，例如用于均衡校正计算。\\ *atom1, atom2,*\\ :math:`\\dots` 可以是 "
"Z-matrix 行号或标签名。连续原子范围可以写成 *atom1,-atom2*\\ ，表示从 *atom1* 到 *atom2*\\ （此处 "
"*atom1* 和 *atom2* 为 z-matrix 或 xyz 行号）"

msgid "``COUNTERPOISE [, key1=value, key2=value,…...]``"
msgstr "``COUNTERPOISE [, key1=value, key2=value,…...]``"

